# Windows checkouts turn LF into CRLF by default, and a CRLF shell script is a
# script `sh` refuses to run ("set: Illegal option -"). Pin the files that are
# executed as-is inside the Linux container.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
# Markdown is bundled as raw text (release notes, agent prompts); keep LF so
# a Windows checkout ships the same bytes as Linux.
*.md text eol=lf
